Attribution and upstream notes

This project's design and (where noted) byte-level protocol data draw on the
following open-source work:

- UxPlay (https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay), GPLv3. The AirPlay receiver this
  app runs as a subprocess.
- RPiPlay (https://github.com/FD-/RPiPlay), GPLv3. UxPlay's ancestor.
- AirPlayPC / pcairplay (https://github.com/gbulog/pcairplay), MIT,
  by Grega Bulog.
- AirBridge (https://github.com/NolanCotter/AirBridge), MIT, by Nolan
  Cotter. Source of the validated BLE HID report descriptor and the iOS
  AssistiveTouch quirks documented in docs/04.
- Tether (https://github.com/zackb/tether), MIT. Bluetooth/BlueZ pairing
  lessons cited in docs/07 and docs/research.
- pymobiledevice3 (https://github.com/doronz88/pymobiledevice3), GPLv3.
  Optional sidecar dependency for the USB input path.

Each retains its own copyright and license. None of these projects or their
authors endorse this project. Apple, iPhone, AirPlay, and iOS are trademarks
